<h2 id="who-its-for" emoji="🎯">Who Each Platform Is For</h2>

**Choose Moosend if** your brand operates an ecommerce storefront alongside physical retail, you need automation workflows that respond to purchase behavior, your team cares about seeing email's actual contribution to revenue, or you're managing subscriber lists above 5,000 where AWeber's pricing premium becomes operationally significant. It's also the right call for multi-door groups that want one platform handling automations across multiple brand identities without paying per-brand premiums.

**Choose AWeber if** you're a single-location boutique just launching an email program with minimal budget, your team values phone support for onboarding and troubleshooting, or your email strategy is primarily broadcast-based (weekly newsletters, event announcements) with limited need for behavioral automation. AWeber's free tier gives you room to build an audience before committing to a paid plan.

For multi-location jewelry groups specifically, we've written about the broader platform stack question in our <a href="https://luxeretailstack.com/guides/multi-location-jewelry-retail-tech-stack">multi-location jewelry retail tech stack guide</a>.

