  <strong>Tip:</strong> Regardless of which platform you choose, the single highest-ROI automation any luxury jewelry or fashion brand can deploy is an abandoned cart recovery sequence targeting high-AOV items. A three-email sequence — sent at 1 hour, 24 hours, and 72 hours post-abandonment — consistently recovers 8–15% of abandoned carts in our experience across client accounts. Moosend ships a pre-built template for this that requires only product feed connection and copy customization.
</div>

